# What stays out of the image (docker/Dockerfile; build plan T35): the dataset and everything
# derived from it, runtime output, notebooks, local environments, and every secret. The replayer
# gets data/ as a read-only mount; secrets reach the containers from .env at run time.
# tests/test_compose.py checks a list of paths against these patterns.

# version control, caches, local environments
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/.DS_Store
.venv
venv
**/*.egg-info
build

# the dataset, runtime output and notebooks
data
runs
models
mlruns
mlruns.db
eval/out
notebooks
**/*.csv
**/*.csv.gz
**/*.zip
**/*.npz
**/*.parquet

# secrets: .env (the template stays), the broker's password file, keys and certificates
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
mosquitto/config/passwd
mosquitto/certs
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.crt
**/*.der
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks

# local compose overrides
compose.override.yaml
compose.override.yml
